  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe release packages did not contain the `examples/` directory. The staged tree now has it beside `assets/`.\n\n- Windows zip and installer: `stage_list` in `xtask/src/release_pack.rs` stages `examples/`. The Inno Setup script takes the whole stage, so the installer follows. A missing `examples/` directory is an error that names it. `scripts/installer.ps1` checks two example files.\n- TAR.GZ, deb, rpm, snap: `scripts/package-linux.sh` copies `examples/` into the stage. The deb and rpm install it to `/usr/lib/camcraft/examples`. The snap uses the tar.gz.\n- AppImage: `scripts/package-appimage.sh` copies it to `usr/bin/examples`.\n- Flatpak: `scripts/package-flatpak.sh` installs it to `/app/bin/examples`.\n- macOS app: `scripts/package-macos.sh` copies it to `Contents/Resources/examples`.\n- FreeBSD tarball: `scripts/package-freebsd.sh` copies it.\n- AUR: `aur/PKGBUILD` installs it to `/usr/lib/camcraft/examples`.\n- `release.yml`: only content checks added (`tar -tzf`, `dpkg-deb`, `rpm -qpl`, `unzip -l`, `unsquashfs -l`, AppImage `test -f`). No trigger and no runner label changed.\n\nThe example `.camproj` files embed their model, so they contain no path to `models/`. No example project was edited. Decision: `docs/decisions/2042-package-examples.md`.\n\nA File menu entry for the examples is not in this PR. Follow-up: #2043.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `release_tests::zip_layout_mirrors_release_yml` pins `examples/first-part.camproj`, `examples/first-router-part.camproj` and `examples/models/first-part.obj` in the stage list. It also pins the error for a missing `examples/` directory.\n- `release_tests::package_dry_run_lists_the_release_yml_tree_on_any_host` and `package_stages_and_zips_on_windows` pin the file count (16).\n- `cargo test -p xtask -j 6 release_tests`: 16 passed. `cargo test -p xtask`: 137 passed before the last test edit. `cargo clippy -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- `cargo xtask package --dry-run` lists the example files in the stage.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo package was built. The Linux, macOS, FreeBSD, AppImage, Flatpak, snap, AUR and installer changes were read and not run. The new `release.yml` checks have not run.\n\nProcess change: yes\n\nChangelog: Release packages now include the examples directory with the example projects and model.\n\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #2042\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
